     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><em>Shop the best edibles on Cape Cod – gummies, chocolates, beverages, and more available at <strong>Cape Cod Cannabis</strong> in Wellfleet. </em>Our dispensary, Wellfleet’s first, carries a wide range of infused treats in various THC and CBD ratios. Whether you’re new to edibles or a seasoned consumer, we’ve got the perfect dose and flavor to match your vibe. Shop online and pick up in-store—convenient, discreet, and delicious.</p>",
