     "kind": "nested-accordion",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "What edible dosage is recommended for visitors new to cannabis?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>For beginners we recommend starting with 2.5–5mg of THC and waiting before consuming more. Speak with our team member to learn more about our product catalog at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet. </p>",
         "dev": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "q": "What types of edibles does Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet sell?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>Cape Cod Cannabis offers a rotating selection of Massachusetts-made edibles, including:</p><ul><li><p>Gummies</p></li><li><p>Chocolates</p></li><li><p>Baked goods</p></li><li><p>Cannabis-infused beverages</p></li><li><p>Low-dose and high-dose options</p></li></ul><p>Availability may change based on season and demand.</p>",
         "dev": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "q": "Do you sell vegan or allergen-friendly edibles?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>Some edible options are vegan or made without common allergens. Availability varies, and our team members at Cape Cod Cannabis can help you review ingredient information.</p>",
         "dev": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "q": "Why buy cannabis edibles from Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>We offer:</p><ul><li><p>Licensed, lab-tested Massachusetts edibles</p></li><li><p>A wide variety of dosing options</p></li><li><p>Friendly, educational guidance</p></li><li><p>Convenient access for all on the Cape! </p></li></ul>",
         "dev": []
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "ariaLabels": [
      "Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys"
     ],
